{"asset_key":"ep2/gameplay_story_12600040","episode":"ep2","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"12600040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1260004001:1":{"text":"흠... 좋은 아침입니다. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 다들 푹 쉬셨는지요?","source_cn":"呼啊……抱歉，早。<style=stress><pla...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x32D0B0F09A6B0B06","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"흠... 좋은 아침입니다. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 다들 푹 쉬셨는지요?","female":"흠... 좋은 아침입니다. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 다들 푹 쉬셨는지요?","variant_male_record_index":"141765","variant_female_record_index":"141766","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1260004002:1":{"text":"저희는 잘 잤어요! 그런데 괜찮으세요, 루카 씨? 한숨도 못 주무신 것 같아 보여요.","source_cn":"我们睡得很好！但是你没事吧，卢卡？看起来好像一夜没睡似的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9BF56FE4FC81514","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1260004003:1":{"text":"음, 사방으로 순찰을 도느라 밤새도록 바빴어.","source_cn":"嗯，四处巡逻，忙了一整夜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16EBA38E03056582","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1260004004:1":{"text":"신밧드도 잠이 덜 깬 것 같고요...","source_cn":"辛巴达也一副没睡醒的样子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A4DF57E6D1A898A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1260004005:1":{"text":"...후아아아, 내가 블러디 로즈 사람은 아니지만 러스트 항은 내 고향이나 마찬가지니까 힘 좀 써야지.","s