"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1260004015:0":{"text":"무슨 일이냐, 마오. 침착해. 설마 또 싸움이 난 거야?","source_cn":"怎么了，马奥，冷静点，兄弟们又跟人打起来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x486FEBB1CC91DED9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1260004016:1":{"text":"아, 아닙니다. “들고양이”와 “와일드 베어”가 오늘 아침에 물귀신파를 찾으러 간다더니 그림자도 안 보여서 말입니다.","source_cn":"不、不是，“山猫”跟“暴熊”今天早上说要去找水鬼帮麻烦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAA1312B288C9031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1260004017:1":{"text":"전 그들이 또 물귀신파를 찾아가서 싸움을 걸려는 줄 알고 그들이 자주 가는 곳으로 가서 찾아보려고 했죠. 상황이라도 파악하려고요.","source_cn":"我以为是他们又去找水鬼帮约架，就打算上他们常去的地方找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DDD65FB52097380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1260004018:1":{"text":"그런데, 그런데...\n길거리에 엄청나게 커다란 쥐가 막 뛰어다니는 것 아니겠습니까!!","source_cn":"结果、结果——\\n在街道上，有超级巨大的老鼠在到处乱跑！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BBDD1B76122AF36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1260004019:1":{"text":"거대한 쥐? 설마 어제 그 그레이브본과 무슨 관계라도 있는 건가?!","source_cn":"巨大老鼠？难道和昨天那个亡灵有关？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1569FDE86AF6FB0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1260004020:1":{"text":"어서 가서 확인해 보자!","source_cn":"我们快去看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2562E6FEE3B26C60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"순찰 결과는?","source_cn":"巡逻的结果是？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD7B6CAF400725D03","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"순찰 결과는?","female":"순찰 결과는?","variant_male_record_index":"67990","variant_female_record_index":"67991","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1260004008:1":{"text":"아~무 일도 없었어. 조금 전, 일부러 그 여인과 괴물을 목격했을 가능성이 있는 일꾼을 찾아가 보았는데 그들도 별 이상한 점을 발견하지 못했다고 하고.","source_cn":"完全没事。就在刚才，我还特意走访了下昨天有可能目击到那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A54534C0BCE7F09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"밤새 아무 일도 없었어?","source_cn":"一夜都没事？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7DA22FFB663394F0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"밤새 아무 일도 없었어?","female":"밤새 아무 일도 없었어?","variant_male_record_index":"67992","variant_female_record_index":"67993","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"루카","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}